-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">한 후 연계전공 이수 포기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">변경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">원을 그린에너지융합센터에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">신청장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-