=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">참고사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">문의사항 </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">그린에너지융합센터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">그린에너지관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">201</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕130\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">478-7973 (<a href=\"mailto:mini766@kumoh.ac.kr\"><font color=\"#0066cc\">mini766@kumoh.ac.kr</font></a>)</span></span></span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
